@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

actor "物业审核员" as Reviewer
participant "ReviewUI" as UI
participant "PetManager" as Ctrl
participant "PetLib" as Lib
participant "消息平台" as MSG

Reviewer -> UI : 打开待审核列表
UI -> Lib : listPendingApplications()
Lib --> UI : 返回待审核列表

Reviewer -> UI : 选择申请\n点击"审核通过"
UI -> Ctrl : approveApplication(appId)
Ctrl -> Lib : updateStatus(appId, APPROVED)
Ctrl -> Lib : createCertificate(petId, 有效期365天)
Lib --> Ctrl : 成功
Ctrl -> MSG : 推送审核通过通知
Ctrl --> UI : 审核通过
UI --> Reviewer : 显示审核成功

note right: 也可"要求补交"或"驳回"
@enduml